description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-07-15T09:22:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108629","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108629.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108629.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The TerrainConstraint has been updated to contain two terrains instead of a single one. All constraints added now look at both the source and target terrains so that transitions between terrain types can be kept.\r\n\r\nInstead of updating constraints incrementally, all constraints between all neighboring tiles are found at the beginning based on the terrain of their neighboring cells and their center bit. Will contain the expected terrain of the cell to be modified as well as the expected terrain of all peering bits as constraints.\r\n\r\nWhen scoring patterns, take into consideration both terrains of the constraint unless it is a center bit, in which case only the center constraint is considered.\r\n\r\nRemoved function `_get_terrain_constraints_from_painted_cells_list` as finding the best terrain is no longer needed if both terrains are being added.\r\n\r\nAdded function _get_terrain_for_cell to lookup proper terrain.\r\n\r\nAdded additional TerrainConstraint bit for both square and isometric tiling such that each bit is unique for two neighboring cells. Without this change directions of constraint become ambiguous in certain cases. This ambiguity still appears in hex tiling, but because some corners are not adjacent to any cells this cannot be easily resolved and the existing mapping is used.\r\n\r\nFixes #89844\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108629/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}